[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2976926988","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105187#issuecomment-2976926988","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105187","id":2976926988,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xcE0M","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-16T14:40:05Z","updated_at":"2025-06-16T14:40:05Z","body":"Can you test if this happens in 4.4.1?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2976926988/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2978515165","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105187#issuecomment-2978515165","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105187","id":2978515165,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xiIjd","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-17T00:04:37Z","updated_at":"2025-06-17T00:04:37Z","body":"This isn't specific to double precision builds, standard builds also need to cast `long` to `int` (or `int` to `long`). Double precision builds only change the meaning of `real_t` to be `double` instead of `float`.\n\nIn Godot, scalar types are basically always 64-bit, but methods may have additional metadata that indicates the real type it's supposed to use. The `_Notification` method, as registered in ClassDB, has metadata for the `what` parameter that indicates it's supposed to be a 32-bit integer, so that's what we use in the generated C# bindings.\n\nUnfortunately, Godot constants don't have metadata so they can't indicate whether it's supposed to be a 64-bit integer or a 32-bit integer, and we have to assume it's a 64-bit integer to be safe.\n\nHowever, I don't think there's any issue with casting if you know it's safe to do so. And in this case, it should be fine. My recommendation would be to cast the `what` parameter to `long` since there is no risk of precision loss and you only have to cast once (instead of casting every `case`):\n\n```csharp\npublic override void _Notification(int what)\n{\n    switch ((long)what)\n    {\n        case NotificationReady:\n            break;\n        default:\n            break;\n    }\n}\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2978515165/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2978999678","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105187#issuecomment-2978999678","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105187","id":2978999678,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xj-1-","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-17T05:33:03Z","updated_at":"2025-06-17T05:33:03Z","body":"> Unfortunately, Godot constants don't have metadata so they can't indicate whether it's supposed to be a 64-bit integer or a 32-bit integer, and we have to assume it's a 64-bit integer to be safe.\n\nI hope we can resolve that during the next binding layer design; this is a usability issue after all, plus I don't see a specific reason for the core team to reject such request (on adding metadata to constants to backing an officially supported language).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2978999678/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2985044833","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105187#issuecomment-2985044833","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105187","id":2985044833,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6x7Cth","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-18T16:57:58Z","updated_at":"2025-06-18T16:57:58Z","body":"I also don't think there's a reason not to add metadata there. But there's no mechanism to add metadata to constants. Signals also have the same problem (see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/65749).\n\nAs you can read in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/65749 we wanted to at least add metadata to signals, but we ran out of time before the 4.0 release and after that we didn't want to break compatibility so we stopped looking into it.\n\nIf metadata is added to Core/GDExtension, we can consider using it in the new bindings generator but we also have to consider compatibility there. While we're more willing to break compatibility because it's a new package, we still don't want to do so unnecessarily. We want the upgrade process to be simple and easy for existing projects.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2985044833/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5359780946","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105187#issuecomment-5359780946","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105187","id":5359780946,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABP3fEUg","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-20T18:02:49Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T18:02:49Z","body":"Closing as per the comments above. See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/65749 to track the issue about the signal metadata.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5359780946/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]